repository-code: "https://github.com/mcpware/IntentProbe"
url: "https://github.com/mcpware/IntentProbe"
abstract: "IntentProbe is a local activation-probing architecture that runs one frozen language-model forward pass and reuses its hidden states across independently trained task heads. The current shared-runtime benchmark serves 16 probes spanning toxicity, jailbreak, spam, sentiment, emotion, and conversational pragmatics; authorization and memory-write probes are separate research releases."
